[{:db/id 17592186119850 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-200dace6-387b-586f-87ab-a5501c01cbe0"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-200dace6-387b-586f-87ab-a5501c01cbe0" :question/id #uuid "200dace6-387b-586f-87ab-a5501c01cbe0" :question/math-academy-id "q-130851" :question/problem "Given that $det(A)=det(B),$ which of the following elementary row operations transforms matrix $A$ to matrix $B,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}]?\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Since $det(A)=det(B)$, the row operation applied to $A$ must be to add or subtract a multiple of one row to another row. In other words, it is of the form \n\n$$\n{R}_{j}:={R}_{j}+(k){R}_{i},\\,i\\ne j.\n$$\n\nBy considering the given row operations that are of the above form, we notice that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}| & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =det(B).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c75bea69-7db0-5820-97b1-b5dd95b8b845"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c75bea69-7db0-5820-97b1-b5dd95b8b845" :answer-field/id #uuid "c75bea69-7db0-5820-97b1-b5dd95b8b845" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-21bc26a0-57ad-5e62-a6e6-621e2ba24583" :answer-field/choices ["answer-54d72f80-7a7b-5b93-a0ec-2d6edad08ac4" "answer-acde6755-f2db-5c6c-bdc1-ac03bdaa2931" "answer-6c11e90f-184e-57bd-b3ed-1971d8fb82ed" "answer-21bc26a0-57ad-5e62-a6e6-621e2ba24583" "answer-171230a8-065f-5312-91ff-166c6fb3df4f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-54d72f80-7a7b-5b93-a0ec-2d6edad08ac4" :answer/id #uuid "54d72f80-7a7b-5b93-a0ec-2d6edad08ac4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+(-1){R}_{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-acde6755-f2db-5c6c-bdc1-ac03bdaa2931" :answer/id #uuid "acde6755-f2db-5c6c-bdc1-ac03bdaa2931" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{1}↔{R}_{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c11e90f-184e-57bd-b3ed-1971d8fb82ed" :answer/id #uuid "6c11e90f-184e-57bd-b3ed-1971d8fb82ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:=-{R}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-21bc26a0-57ad-5e62-a6e6-621e2ba24583" :answer/id #uuid "21bc26a0-57ad-5e62-a6e6-621e2ba24583" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-171230a8-065f-5312-91ff-166c6fb3df4f" :answer/id #uuid "171230a8-065f-5312-91ff-166c6fb3df4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+{R}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-11b6f742-f965-5993-a06f-bca8dfba7485" :activity/id #uuid "11b6f742-f965-5993-a06f-bca8dfba7485" :activity/title "Row and Column Operations on Determinants" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048462 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-5b098fcf-c1b8-5f75-8b3a-28dc83ab8997" "step-9e253f5b-694c-5716-b2be-ec3f736b8398" "step-5a731d48-68b1-58c7-b15e-4a787d1f4b44" "step-796d84ed-30ec-5eef-9c9e-3ecd61007abc" "step-0950983d-5529-5332-ba75-7636f5397a6b"] :activity/first-step "step-5b098fcf-c1b8-5f75-8b3a-28dc83ab8997" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-5b098fcf-c1b8-5f75-8b3a-28dc83ab8997" :step/id #uuid "5b098fcf-c1b8-5f75-8b3a-28dc83ab8997" :step/content 17592186329661 :step/next "step-9e253f5b-694c-5716-b2be-ec3f736b8398" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-9e253f5b-694c-5716-b2be-ec3f736b8398" :step/id #uuid "9e253f5b-694c-5716-b2be-ec3f736b8398" :step/content 1759218634185